{"decisions":[{"index":0,"keep":true,"reason":"`NewOutboxTransaction` accepts an existing `Database` without initializing or validating its maps. With non-nil `orders` and nil `outbox`, `Save` successfully writes `database.orders[order.ID]` and then panics on `database.outbox[event.ID]`, leaving a partial commit. This database state worked before the change because the previous save path never wrote to `outbox`, so the regression is introduced and actionable."}]}
